          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 42,
          "value": "What is the difference between Online and Offline participation?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 42,
          "value": "Online participation is remotely coordinated; Offline participation involves travelling to Gaya for in-person services. Suitability depends on the family’s circumstances and guidance."
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 43,
          "value": "Is the ritual shown live?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 43,
          "value": "A live session may be arranged when included in the confirmed service plan and practical conditions permit."
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 44,
          "value": "Can multiple family members join?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 44,
          "value": "Yes, eligible family members may join when access and participation arrangements are confirmed beforehand."
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 45,
          "value": "Can NRIs book the service?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "list:faqs",
          "line": 45,
          "value": "Yes. NRI and international families may request online coordination, subject to timing and service suitability."
        },
        {
